  "description": "A .NET library providing unified error handling for ASP.NET Core applications. The package implements middleware that catches exceptions and transforms them into standardized JSON responses with proper HTTP status codes.\n\n      Key Features:\n      - Global exception handling middleware\n      - Standardized error response format\n      - Built-in support for common exception types\n      - Request correlation tracking\n      - Configurable stack trace visibility\n      - Consistent logging\n\n      Designed to streamline error handling across microservices and web applications while maintaining proper error tracking and debugging capabilities.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Cross.ErrorHandlers",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-21T01:20:45.983Z",
